OL,3,GNEWSAMan's 20-year credit nightmare
OL,4,Aover identity mix-up
OL,5,
OL,6,FA Lancashire man says he has been
OL,7,Fcaught up in a credit "nightmare" for
OL,8,F20 years, after being confused with
OL,9,Fanother individual, who shares his name
OL,10,Fand date of birth, but is constantly
OL,11,Fstruggling with debt.
OL,13,FCarl Graham Williamson, from Blackpool,
OL,14,Fsaid it has resulted in his credit
OL,15,Frating being impacted, and bailiffs
OL,16,Fcoming to his home.
OL,18,FThe 43-year-old said the other 'Carl
OL,19,FWilliamson' has incurred a debt of
OL,20,Fabout #120,000, including unpaid
OL,21,Fparking and traffic fines.
OL,23,APub: 30-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NW Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
